 *   **VoxelCoord:** A struct with integer fields `x`, `y`, `z`. Hash function for sparse variants uses primes $p_1=73856093, p_2=19349663, p_3=83492791$: $hash = x \cdot p_1 \oplus y \cdot p_2 \oplus z \cdot p_3$ [S1, unofficial].
 
